---
layout: base.njk
title: My Blog
og_title: My Blog – Jonathan Thompson
description: Browse my latest blog posts, insights, and behind-the-scenes content on filmmaking, post-production, and more.
canonical: https://itsjonathanthompson.com/blog/
og_image:
pagecss: <link rel="stylesheet" href="/resources/css/blog.css">
pagejs: <script src="/resources/js/blog.js" defer></script>
---

<div id="blog-page">
    <header class="blog-header pop-in" role="banner" aria-label="Blog Header">
        <h1 class="blog-title">The Cutting Room</h1>
        <p class="blog-subtitle">My insights from behind the scenes <small style="font-size: 0.9rem;">(that should probably be cut)</small></p>
    </header>

    <div class="categories-strip pop-in" aria-label="Blog Categories">
        <a href="/blog/" class="category-tag active" aria-label="Show all blog posts">All</a>
        <a href="/blog/tags/post-production/" class="category-tag" aria-label="Show posts tagged Post-Production">Post-Production</a>
        {# <a href="/blog/tags/production/" class="category-tag" aria-label="Show posts tagged Production">Production</a> #}
        <a href="/blog/tags/writing/" class="category-tag" aria-label="Show posts tagged Writing">Writing</a>
        <a href="/blog/tags/sound-design/" class="category-tag" aria-label="Show posts tagged Sound Design">Sound Design</a>
        <a href="/blog/tags/film-tv/" class="category-tag" aria-label="Show posts tagged Film & TV">Film & TV</a>
        <a href="/blog/tags/the-walking-dead/" class="category-tag" aria-label="Show posts tagged The Walking Dead">The Walking Dead</a>
    </div>

    <div class="blog-grid" aria-label="Latest Blog Posts">
        {% set latestPosts = collections.blogPosts | slice(0, 4) %}
        {% for post in latestPosts %}
        <article class="blog-post {% if loop.index0 == 0 %}featured{% endif %} pop-in">
            <div class="post-meta">
                <div class="post-meta-tags">
                    {% for tag in post.data.tags %}
                    <a href="/blog/tags/{{ tag | slugify }}/" class="post-category {{ tag | slugify }}" aria-label="Show posts tagged {{ tag | titleCase }}">{{ tag | titleCase }}</a>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
                <div class="post-meta-info">
                    <span class="post-date">{{ post.data.date | dateFormat }}</span>
                    <span class="reading-time">{{ post.templateContent | readingTime }} min read</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% if loop.index0 == 0 %}
            <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}" aria-label="Read full post: {{ post.data.title }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
            {% else %}
            <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}" aria-label="Read full post: {{ post.data.title }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
            {% endif %}
            <p class="post-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
            <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="read-more" aria-label="Read more about {{ post.data.title }}">Read More →</a>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="blog-navigation pop-in" aria-label="Blog Navigation">
        <div class="nav-buttons">
            <a href="/blog/posts/" class="nav-button primary" aria-label="View all blog posts">
                <span class="nav-icon">📚</span>
                <span class="nav-text">
                    <strong>View All Posts</strong>
                    <small>Browse {{ collections.blogPosts.length }} articles</small>
                </span>
            </a>
            <a href="/blog/tags/" class="nav-button secondary" aria-label="Browse blog posts by tag">
                <span class="nav-icon">🏷️</span>
                <span class="nav-text">
                    <strong>Browse by Tags</strong>
                    <small>Explore {{ collections.blogTags.length }} categories</small>
                </span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="blog-intro pop-in">
        <h2>Why "The Cutting Room"?</h2>
        <p>In a standard production, the cutting room is where the entire project comes together. Where all assets and ideas get mended together before shipping the final product out. It is the last time in the process where things can truly remain unfiltered. <u>This is my cutting room.</u> The only spot where you can take a glimpse at my unfiltered thoughts and hopefully learn something about me and why I believe filmmaking to be such a compelling art form.</p>
    </section>
</div>
